  "prefLabel": "Lot 7202.21 High-stakes tournament",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 7202.21 “High-stakes tournament” means “high-stakes tournament” as defined in RSA 287-D:1, XII, namely “a tournament of a GOC in which the required buy-in for participation in the tournament is $2,500 or greater.”\n\nSource. #14341, EMERGENCY, eff 8-21-25); ss by #14503, eff 2-4-26, EXPIRES: 2-4-36 (formerly Lot 7202.14)",
